<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>密码帮助 · SEO GEO</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/app.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/p10.css">
</head>
<body class="auth-login-page">
  <main class="auth-login-shell" data-ui="password-help-page">
    <section class="auth-login-marketing" aria-labelledby="password-help-title">
      <div class="auth-login-brand" aria-label="SEO GEO">
        <span class="auth-login-brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">SG</span>
        <span>SEO GEO</span>
      </div>
      <div class="auth-login-message">
        <p class="auth-login-eyebrow">账户安全</p>
        <h1 id="password-help-title">密码重置由管理员协助完成</h1>
        <p class="auth-login-lead">请联系为你开通账户的系统管理员，核验身份后重置密码。</p>
      </div>
      <p class="auth-login-trust">本页面不会查询账户，也不会透露邮箱是否已注册。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="auth-login-form-side" aria-label="密码帮助">
      <div class="auth-login-card">
        <div class="auth-login-card-heading">
          <p class="auth-login-eyebrow">需要帮助？</p>
          <h2>联系系统管理员</h2>
          <p>出于安全原因，系统当前不通过公开页面发送重置链接。管理员完成身份核验后，可为你安全重置密码。</p>
        </div>
        <a class="auth-login-submit" href="/auth/login">返回登录</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
